                            <comment id="15120063" author="wheat9" created="Wed, 27 Jan 2016 19:48:19 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;It&apos;s very useful feature. What&apos;s the status of this jira? I can help on addressing the feedbacks.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15572615" author="rehevkor5" created="Thu, 13 Oct 2016 17:31:37 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;For those who are looking for this feature, when you run the parquet-tools &quot;meta&quot; command, you can find the row count after &quot;RC:&quot;, for example: &quot;row group 1: &lt;b&gt;RC:2040356&lt;/b&gt; ...&quot;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16008785" author="julienledem" created="Fri, 12 May 2017 22:02:43 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Issue resolved by pull request 406&lt;br/&gt;
