                            <comment id="17728039" author="JIRAUSER300654" created="Wed, 31 May 2023 15:53:01 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Can I know the difference between pretty and detailed size?&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Gives same results. Code also looks same.&#160;&lt;br/&gt;
Is that something like size -pretty means only datablock size and size -detailed means completed parquet file size (header+datablocks+footer)?&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
